MODULE: EchoRecordedAsApplied
TARGET: NoOwnOriginApplied
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reflected own-origin echo is recorded by the receiver's dedup as applied
PERTURBS: Reflect

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' # inflight
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, applied, hwm, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' # inflight
    /\ applied' = applied \cup {[k |-> k, ts |-> aStore[k].ts, del |-> aStore[k].del, org |-> "B"]}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, hwm, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- END
